## How to Track Progress

Progress is tracked via checkboxes in `web-sdk-plan/v1/MILESTONES.md`.

When Claude verifies a milestone's exit criteria and they all pass, tick the checkboxes:
- `- [ ]` → `- [x]`

Use `/web-sdk verify <phase>` in Claude to trigger a full verification pass against a milestone's done criteria.
